## Why This Is Asked
Tests whether the candidate can design a scalable, secure, end-to-end real-time fraud pipeline across AWS services, with cross-account/data-sharing constraints and privacy controls.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven ingestion and fan-out
- Real-time scoring with SageMaker endpoints
- Data retention and lifecycle in S3
- Compact indexing in DynamoDB
- Remediation workflow via SQS
- Idempotency, DLQ, and schema evolution
- Privacy: masking, encryption at rest/in transit
- Multi-region replication and cross-account access

